<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Compaq estimates raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Compaq estimates raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial Group said analyst Mark Specker raised his fiscal 1997 earnings per share estimate on Compaq Computer Corp to $6.29 from $5.69.</p>
<p>-- He maintained his short- and long-term buy ratings on the stock, which was up 2-7/8 to 86-3/8.</p>
</text>
